# The indexed path of an occurrence, `s\[N]name` (the book, fields): Holder\[1]Model is the second record Model of
# Holder, with three fields (plan M11 5a).
# Plan M11 5v: the declarations of ordinary Structures live in the data part of main; the root holds places and the call main().
# The path is read in the code of main (in_code) and from the root through main\data (seen).
sub: main () (
    Holder:
        Model: a b
        Model: c d e
    int: in_code 0
)
    in_code := length(Holder\[1]Model)
main()
int: seen length(main\data\Holder\[1]Model)
int: seen_in_code main\data\in_code
